{"additionalPlain":"We are committed to diversity, inclusion, and accessibility.  We are an Equal Opportunity Employer in all aspects of employment and do not discriminate for employment because of race, color, sex, age, national origin, religion, sexual orientation, gender identity and/or expression, status as a veteran, and basis of disability or any other federal, state or local protected class.\n","additional":"<div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">We are committed to diversity, inclusion, and accessibility.&nbsp; We are an Equal Opportunity Employer in all aspects of employment and do not discriminate for employment because of race, color, sex, age, national origin, religion, sexual orientation, gender identity and/or expression, status as a veteran, and basis of disability or any other federal, state or local protected class.</span></div>","categories":{"commitment":"Full-time Remote","department":"Upcoming Opportunities","location":"Washington DC","team":"Healthcare Technology","allLocations":["Washington DC"]},"createdAt":1786974287713,"descriptionPlain":"Founded in early 2021, Ibility is a Service-Disabled Veteran-Owned Small Business and a Woman-Owned Small Business, headquartered in Gaithersburg, MD.  Ibility is a small but mighty company that is positioned for rapid growth.  Simply put, we help government leaders to achieve their mission by designing creative products and programs that delight their customers and make their employees more efficient - building trust and improving overall satisfaction. We use human-centered design principles in every engagement because we believe the end-user is critical to the long-term success of any solution. Our team is fun, passionate, bold, and creative.  We live our mission every day – to inspire people, create cool stuff, and make a lasting impact on the world!\n\n\nPosition Overview: \nThe Project Manager provides project management and operational support for a federally funded program, working across multidisciplinary teams to support successful planning, execution, and evaluation of program activities. This role is responsible for coordinating project priorities, schedules, milestones, risks, and deliverables while maintaining alignment across leadership, stakeholders, and subject matter experts. The Project Manager also supports Agile program management, change management, data analysis, and strategic communications activities to help drive effective implementation and informed decision-making. The position will develop executive-level reporting and briefings, monitor program performance, and translate project information and data into clear, actionable insights for program leadership. \nKey Responsibilities: \nCoordinate project management activities supporting the planning, execution, and evaluation of pilot program initiatives, ensuring alignment with program objectives, timelines, milestones, and deliverables. \n\n\n","description":"<div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Founded in early 2021, Ibility is a Service-Disabled Veteran-Owned Small Business and a Woman-Owned Small Business, headquartered in Gaithersburg, MD.&nbsp; Ibility is a small but mighty company that is positioned for rapid growth.&nbsp; Simply put, we help government leaders to achieve their mission by designing creative products and programs that delight their customers and make their employees more efficient - building trust and improving overall satisfaction. We use human-centered design principles in every engagement because we believe the end-user is critical to the long-term success of any solution. Our team is fun, passionate, bold, and creative.&nbsp; We live our mission every day – to inspire people, create cool stuff, and make a lasting impact on the world!</span></div><div><br></div><div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Position Overview:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">The Project Manager provides project management and operational support for a federally funded program, working across multidisciplinary teams to support successful planning, execution, and evaluation of program activities. This role is responsible for coordinating project priorities, schedules, milestones, risks, and deliverables while maintaining alignment across leadership, stakeholders, and subject matter experts. The Project Manager also supports Agile program management, change management, data analysis, and strategic communications activities to help drive effective implementation and informed decision-making. The position will develop executive-level reporting and briefings, monitor program performance, and translate project information and data into clear, actionable insights for program leadership.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Key Responsibilities:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:370,&quot;335559991&quot;:370,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Coordinate project management activities supporting the planning, execution, and evaluation of pilot program initiatives, ensuring alignment with program objectives, timelines, milestones, and deliverables.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:370,&quot;335559991&quot;:370,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Manage project schedules, priorities, risks, issues, dependencies, and action items while coordinating across leadership, project teams, stakeholders, and subject matter experts (SMEs) to drive successful execution.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:370,&quot;335559991&quot;:370,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Support Agile program management and change management activities, including planning, stakeholder engagement, organizational readiness, implementation, adoption, and continuous improvement efforts.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:370,&quot;335559991&quot;:370,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Conduct and support data analysis to monitor program performance, evaluate key metrics and trends, and translate findings into actionable insights and recommendations for program leadership.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:370,&quot;335559991&quot;:370,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Develop executive-level reports, dashboards, presentations, and briefings that clearly communicate program status, performance, accomplishments, risks, and strategic recommendations.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:370,&quot;335559991&quot;:370,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Support strategic communications and stakeholder engagement activities to ensure consistent messaging, facilitate informed decision-making, and maintain alignment across program teams and leadership.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p aria-level=\"3\" role=\"heading\"><strong><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">Required Qualifications:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Bachelor’s degree from an accredited college or university in Business Administration, Project Management, Management, or a related field.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Minimum of four (4) years of professional project management experience, including experience planning, coordinating, and executing projects from initiation through completion.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Possess an active Project Management Professional (PMP) certification from the Project Management Institute (PMI).</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience collaborating with cross-functional teams and stakeholders to coordinate project activities, monitor progress, and ensure alignment with project objectives, timelines, and priorities.</span><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience using project management and collaboration tools such as Microsoft Project, Smartsheet, Microsoft Teams, SharePoint, or similar platforms to manage project schedules, milestones, tasks, dependencies, and deliverables.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience developing project plans, schedules, status reports, dashboards, and other project management artifacts to support project execution and performance monitoring.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p aria-level=\"3\" role=\"heading\"><strong><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">Preferred Qualifications:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Master’s degree in Business Administration, Project Management, Management, Public Administration, Healthcare Administration, or a related field.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"8\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Five (5) or more years of professional experience in a project management environment, supporting the planning, execution, monitoring, and delivery of complex projects or initiatives.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"9\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience working directly with federal government clients, preferably supporting the Department of Veterans Affairs (VA), Veterans Health Administration (VHA), or other federal healthcare agencies.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"10\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Demonstrated experience leading projects, workstreams, or cross-functional teams, including coordinating project activities, managing priorities, and driving deliverables through completion.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"11\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience developing executive-level reports, dashboards, presentations, and briefings that clearly communicate project status, performance, risks, issues, milestones, and recommendations to senior leadership.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"12\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience facilitating project meetings, stakeholder discussions, and leadership briefings, including documenting decisions, action items, and follow-up activities.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Benefits:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">Health, Dental, and Vision Plans</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">Short Term Disability</span> <span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">/</span> <span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">Long Term Disability</span> <span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">/</span> <span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">Life Insurance</span> <span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">/</span> <span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">Accidental Death and Dismemberment</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">Health Savings Account</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">Unlimited Paid Time Off</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">11 Federal Holidays Off</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">401k</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","id":"b481e759-1440-4fe4-9da0-a4b39845bea8","lists":[],"salaryRange":{"min":100000,"max":110000,"currency":"USD","interval":"per-year-salary"},"text":"Project Manager","country":"US","workplaceType":"remote","opening":"<div><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Founded in early 2021, Ibility is a Service-Disabled Veteran-Owned Small Business and a Woman-Owned Small Business, headquartered in Gaithersburg, MD.&nbsp; Ibility is a small but mighty company that is positioned for rapid growth.&nbsp; Simply put, we help government leaders to achieve their mission by designing creative products and programs that delight their customers and make their employees more efficient - building trust and improving overall satisfaction. We use human-centered design principles in every engagement because we believe the end-user is critical to the long-term success of any solution. Our team is fun, passionate, bold, and creative.&nbsp; We live our mission every day &ndash; to inspire people, create cool stuff, and make a lasting impact on the world!</span></div>","openingPlain":"Founded in early 2021, Ibility is a Service-Disabled Veteran-Owned Small Business and a Woman-Owned Small Business, headquartered in Gaithersburg, MD.  Ibility is a small but mighty company that is positioned for rapid growth.  Simply put, we help government leaders to achieve their mission by designing creative products and programs that delight their customers and make their employees more efficient - building trust and improving overall satisfaction. We use human-centered design principles in every engagement because we believe the end-user is critical to the long-term success of any solution. Our team is fun, passionate, bold, and creative.  We live our mission every day – to inspire people, create cool stuff, and make a lasting impact on the world!\n","descriptionBody":"<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Position Overview:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">The Project Manager provides project management and operational support for a federally funded program, working across multidisciplinary teams to support successful planning, execution, and evaluation of program activities. This role is responsible for coordinating project priorities, schedules, milestones, risks, and deliverables while maintaining alignment across leadership, stakeholders, and subject matter experts. The Project Manager also supports Agile program management, change management, data analysis, and strategic communications activities to help drive effective implementation and informed decision-making. The position will develop executive-level reporting and briefings, monitor program performance, and translate project information and data into clear, actionable insights for program leadership.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Key Responsibilities:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:370,&quot;335559991&quot;:370,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"2\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Coordinate project management activities supporting the planning, execution, and evaluation of pilot program initiatives, ensuring alignment with program objectives, timelines, milestones, and deliverables.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:370,&quot;335559991&quot;:370,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"2\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Manage project schedules, priorities, risks, issues, dependencies, and action items while coordinating across leadership, project teams, stakeholders, and subject matter experts (SMEs) to drive successful execution.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:370,&quot;335559991&quot;:370,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"2\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Support Agile program management and change management activities, including planning, stakeholder engagement, organizational readiness, implementation, adoption, and continuous improvement efforts.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:370,&quot;335559991&quot;:370,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"2\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Conduct and support data analysis to monitor program performance, evaluate key metrics and trends, and translate findings into actionable insights and recommendations for program leadership.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:370,&quot;335559991&quot;:370,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"2\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Develop executive-level reports, dashboards, presentations, and briefings that clearly communicate program status, performance, accomplishments, risks, and strategic recommendations.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:370,&quot;335559991&quot;:370,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"2\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Support strategic communications and stakeholder engagement activities to ensure consistent messaging, facilitate informed decision-making, and maintain alignment across program teams and leadership.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\"><strong><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">Required Qualifications:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"5\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Bachelor&rsquo;s degree from an accredited college or university in Business Administration, Project Management, Management, or a related field.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"5\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Minimum of four (4) years of professional project management experience, including experience planning, coordinating, and executing projects from initiation through completion.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"5\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Possess an active Project Management Professional (PMP) certification from the Project Management Institute (PMI).</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"5\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience collaborating with cross-functional teams and stakeholders to coordinate project activities, monitor progress, and ensure alignment with project objectives, timelines, and priorities.</span><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"5\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience using project management and collaboration tools such as Microsoft Project, Smartsheet, Microsoft Teams, SharePoint, or similar platforms to manage project schedules, milestones, tasks, dependencies, and deliverables.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"5\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience developing project plans, schedules, status reports, dashboards, and other project management artifacts to support project execution and performance monitoring.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\"><strong><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">Preferred Qualifications:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"5\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Master&rsquo;s degree in Business Administration, Project Management, Management, Public Administration, Healthcare Administration, or a related field.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"8\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"5\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Five (5) or more years of professional experience in a project management environment, supporting the planning, execution, monitoring, and delivery of complex projects or initiatives.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"9\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"5\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience working directly with federal government clients, preferably supporting the Department of Veterans Affairs (VA), Veterans Health Administration (VHA), or other federal healthcare agencies.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"10\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"5\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Demonstrated experience leading projects, workstreams, or cross-functional teams, including coordinating project activities, managing priorities, and driving deliverables through completion.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"11\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"5\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience developing executive-level reports, dashboards, presentations, and briefings that clearly communicate project status, performance, risks, issues, milestones, and recommendations to senior leadership.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"5\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience facilitating project meetings, stakeholder discussions, and leadership briefings, including documenting decisions, action items, and follow-up activities.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Benefits:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"1\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">Health, Dental, and Vision Plans</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"1\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">Short Term Disability</span> <span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">/</span> <span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">Long Term Disability</span> <span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">/</span> <span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">Life Insurance</span> <span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">/</span> <span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">Accidental Death and Dismemberment</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"1\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">Health Savings Account</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"1\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">Unlimited Paid Time Off</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"1\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">11 Federal Holidays Off</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"1\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Strong\">401k</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","descriptionBodyPlain":"Position Overview: \nThe Project Manager provides project management and operational support for a federally funded program, working across multidisciplinary teams to support successful planning, execution, and evaluation of program activities. This role is responsible for coordinating project priorities, schedules, milestones, risks, and deliverables while maintaining alignment across leadership, stakeholders, and subject matter experts. The Project Manager also supports Agile program management, change management, data analysis, and strategic communications activities to help drive effective implementation and informed decision-making. The position will develop executive-level reporting and briefings, monitor program performance, and translate project information and data into clear, actionable insights for program leadership. \nKey Responsibilities: \nCoordinate project management activities supporting the planning, execution, and evaluation of pilot program initiatives, ensuring alignment with program objectives, timelines, milestones, and deliverables. \n\n\n","hostedUrl":"https://jobs.lever.co/ibility/b481e759-1440-4fe4-9da0-a4b39845bea8","applyUrl":"https://jobs.lever.co/ibility/b481e759-1440-4fe4-9da0-a4b39845bea8/apply"}